    "notes": "Needs ComfyUI-Frame-Interpolation (the 'RIFE VFI' node, class name has a space in it) and ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite. The source is resampled to 30 fps on load and doubled, so the answer is exactly 60 fps whatever the input rate was."
  },
  "line": {
    "name": "Interpolate to 60fps",
